⚠️ Important Notes

❌ Don’t do this:

Table(
    {Value:"Code"},
    {Value:"Supplier"},
    Distinct(...)
)

👉 This causes invalid structure / nested tables


---

✅ Always flatten using:

Collect()

AddColumns()



---

💡 Pro Tip (Best Practice)

Add a Type column so you can control behavior later:

Clear(colHeader);

// Static
Collect(colHeader, {Value: "Code", Type: "Static"});
Collect(colHeader, {Value: "Supplier", Type: "Static"});

// Dynamic
Collect(
    colHeader,
    AddColumns(
        Distinct('SE Question List', Title),
        "Value", Result,
        "Type", "Question"
    )
);

Then you can do:

